        {
          "text": " Paul ekiyakia loka Kristo Yesu kanuka akot naka Edeke, ka Timoteo onacewok, Mama ejai ekanisa loka Edeke loejai Korinto, nenipe ka lukalaunak kere luejaas Akaia kere:",
